Answer: The full answer has to be inside first [INSTR](http://www.astro-wiki.org/node/2010/instruction/instruction_INSTR/instr_index.html) with the following parameter:

\begin{code}
START=My_Beginning''START state
\end{code}

and second [INST](http://www.astro-wiki.org/node/2010/instruction/instruction_INST/instr_index.html), second INTRO, with the following parameters unner the `structure_id`:

\begin{code}
END=My_Ending'''END state
\end{code}

