\strong{Norm}

Norm of a given structure is defined as the percent of the Pauling radii of the atoms in graphene. For example in the given structure the norm is 100 % of the Pauling radii \strong{\em{(In this answer length is used to define Pauling radius not the number of atoms)}}

\begin{blockquote}

